B.chJ=new A.ia("Jobs and bids","How do I create a service request?","Open Upload, enter the work title, description, budget, and location, then submit the request. Artisans can bid while the request is open.","create job request upload budget location customer")
B.chM=new A.ia("Jobs and bids","How does an artisan submit or edit a bid?","Open an available job, enter your amount and message, then send the bid. You can edit it until the customer accepts a bid.","artisan bid offer edit amount price")
B.chS=new A.ia("Jobs and bids","What happens after a bid is accepted?","Chat opens for both parties, the agreed amount appears in Wallet, and Job tracking becomes available for ETA, start, and completion updates.","accepted won chat wallet tracking start completion")
B.chP=new A.ia("Tracking","How do I update job progress or ETA?","Open the accepted job and use Job tracking. The accepted artisan requests work start and completion, then the customer confirms each step. After completion is confirmed, the customer can rate or comment on the work.","timeline eta progress started completed status schedule")
B.chI=new A.ia("Invoices and wallet","Where is the invoice for accepted work?","Open Wallet and select the accepted job. The invoice contains the agreed bid amount, customer, artisan, work location, and invoice number.","invoice receipt wallet accepted amount money")
B.chH=new A.ia("Invoices and wallet","How does an artisan send an invoice?","Open the invoice from Wallet and tap Send invoice to chat, or tap the invoice icon inside the customer chat and choose accepted work.","send share invoice artisan customer chat pdf")
B.chN=new A.ia("Invoices and wallet","How do I print or share an invoice PDF?","Open an invoice from Wallet or chat, then use Print invoice or Share invoice. Share uses the phone sharing menu for email, messaging, storage, and other apps.","print pdf download share outside email whatsapp")
B.chR=new A.ia("Chat","Why can an artisan not chat before bid acceptance?","Job chats stay locked until the customer accepts that artisan\u2019s bid. This keeps negotiations connected to a confirmed job and protects both parties.","chat locked disabled before bid accepted")
B.chK=new A.ia("Account","How do I reset a forgotten password?","On the sign-in screen tap Forgot password, enter your account email, and open the secure link sent to your inbox. Check spam if it is not visible.","forgot password reset recovery email login")
B.chL=new A.ia("Account","How do I change language or follow phone dark mode?","Open Profile, then App settings. Choose a language and select System under Theme to follow the phone\u2019s light or dark appearance automatically.","language translation dark mode theme system phone")
B.chQ=new A.ia("Safety","How do I report or block a chat?","Open the chat menu and choose Report or Block. Include a clear reason so the admin support team can review the conversation.","report block abuse safety conversation")
B.chO=new A.ia("Safety","What should I verify before paying or visiting a site?","Confirm the artisan verification badge, agreed bid, job location, and invoice details. Keep important agreements in chat and never share passwords or verification codes.","verification payment safety site visit scam code")
